WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.850
October, ten sixty-six.

2
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.370
At the Battle of Hastings,

3
00:00:04.420 --> 00:00:08.430
a duke from northern France
defeats the English king, Harold.

4
00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:12.010
On Christmas Day, Duke
William is crowned king.

5
00:00:12.060 --> 00:00:14.490
But the Normans are a small group.

6
00:00:14.540 --> 00:00:19.210
Around them is a much larger
population, and it is not happy.

7
00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:23.030
So how can so few people
control a whole country?

8
00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:26.430
In this mission, you'll see
how William won the crown.

9
00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:29.230
You'll meet castles of earth and wood,

10
00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:34.010
a giant survey called the Domesday
Book, and a pyramid of power.

11
00:00:34.060 --> 00:00:38.570
Your mission: discover how a
few Normans held on to England.
